+  /**
+   * Read-only view of every active, reachable celld workspace (issue #18).
+   * The registry is routing authority only; membership and names come from
+   * the cell snapshot, exactly as the HTTP read model reports them. Snapshot
+   * reads issue no command. An unreachable cell hides only its own
+   * workspace, so one dead node never fails a read that also covers healthy
+   * ones — and a membership that cannot be read is never asserted.
